threads.body:
🟠 **High** `lib/mermaidSvg.ts:32`

Diagram labels containing `var(...)` are rewritten as CSS, so `A["var(--foo)"]` loses its label when `--foo` is unknown, and `var(--pele-bg)` becomes a theme color. `resolve(body)` scans text nodes as well as attributes; resolve attribute values only so label text is preserved.

```diff
-  return root + resolve(body);
+  return root + body.replace(/(\s[\w:-]+=")([^"]*)"/g, (_match, prefix: string, value: string) => `${prefix}${resolve(value)}"`);
```

